notes = "A device has to be installed before anything will run: put a firmware dump in '<system>/eka2l1/firmware' and the core installs it on first start. Content is a Symbian package (.sis, .sisx, .n-gage), or an .eka2l1 shortcut file naming the UID of an application that is already installed."
